Z||000000||Ed||05-16-2001||07:46 PM||||Besides drag racing with V-8's there are other things happening in the Fiero field.<P>We managed to scrape together three cars from our club, and one from San Francisco, plus a local at the Central CA Pontiac, Olds, Buick, GMC show in Madera, CA.  The organizers thanked us for our (Northern CA Chpt.'s) participation, as Fieros aren't usually well represented.  So that was nice. <BR>We may see more of our participation at Pontiac shows as the Fiero inventory declines.  <P>On Sunday we should have about 20 Fieros from the S. F. Bay area/Sacramento, CA, area at the Sears Point vintage races.  We'll be in a "car corral" where one marque is represented. <P>And don't forget the Western Regional "Fiero Fest" in San Leandro on July 13-15 .||||reg||1
